-# "Arkusze ocen". Mockup: #/t/sheets, js-expanded/30-ag.js:31 (the page) and
-# :23-29 (one template panel).
-#
-# Flat, as the mockup is: every template shows its sheets. The Bootstrap
-# version collapsed them behind an accordion and remembered the open one in a
-# cookie, which hid the thing the screen exists to show.
- content_for :title, 'Arkusze ocen'

%section.gh-panel.gh-phead
  .gh-phead-t
    %h1.gh-h1 Arkusze ocen
    %p.gh-lead Arkusze pogrupowane według szablonów. Najnowsze są na górze.

  .gh-rowb
    = link_to new_story_group_activity_group_template_path(@story_group), class: 'gh-btn gh-btn--sec' do
      %i.fa-solid.fa-plus{ 'aria-hidden': 'true' }
      Nowy szablon

- if @index.any?
  - @index.templates.each do |template|
    = render 'template_panel', template: template, fresh_sheet_ids: @fresh_sheet_ids
- else
  -# The mockup has no empty state for this screen. House rule: name the next
  -# action rather than only reporting the absence.
  %section.gh-panel.gh-gm
    %h2.gh-h2 Nie masz jeszcze żadnego szablonu
    %p.gh-lead
      Szablon to zestaw kategorii, za które nagradzasz studentów. Z jednego
      szablonu tworzysz potem kolejne arkusze — po jednym na zajęcia.
